### ── Unauthenticated request (expect 401 from Gateway) ──────────
# Gateway rejects before it reaches case-service
GET {{apiGateway}}/api/cases
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

> {%
  client.test("Unauthenticated request rejected with 401", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "Expected 401, got " + response.status);
  });
%}

